                        "sense_id": "5f118583-e90a-39d5-acd1-ae914772e3f5",
                        "entry_id": "6576159f-106d-36e1-b8b1-59d93ea49360",
                        "glosses": [
                            "hobby horse; a horse costume used in festivals, dances, and play"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "masculine"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b11db523-ed2b-4c0b-9067-57b6133cb62f",
                                "sense_id": "5f118583-e90a-39d5-acd1-ae914772e3f5",
                                "text": "Le même exemplum y est placé juste après celui décrivant le châtiment tout aussi exemplaire des danseurs en cheval-jupon.",
                                "translation": "The same exemplum there is placed just after that describing the equally exemplary punishment of dancers in the hobby horse.",
                                "english": "The same exemplum there is placed just after that describing the equally exemplary punishment of dancers in the hobby horse."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "648b863d-582a-446f-bc9c-4d21e8de3c18",
                                "sense_id": "5f118583-e90a-39d5-acd1-ae914772e3f5",
                                "text": "Le dernier type est le \"cheval-jupon\", un terme que l'ethnologue réserve à un déguisement pour une personne, constitué comme suit : le corps de la personne est entouré à la taille par un tissu — le jupon — recouvrant l'essentiel de ses jambes, une tête du cheval en bois[…]",
                                "translation": "The last type is the \"hobby horse\", a term which Ethnologue reserves for a disguise for a person, made as follows: the body of the person is surrounded at the waist by a cloth — the skirt — covering most of his legs; a horse's head of wood […]",
                                "english": "The last type is the \"hobby horse\", a term which Ethnologue reserves for a disguise for a person, made as follows: the body of the person is surrounded at the waist by a cloth — the skirt — covering most of his legs; a horse's head of wood […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "68a3ee9c-e258-4374-8f34-36d602d11672",
                                "sense_id": "5f118583-e90a-39d5-acd1-ae914772e3f5",
                                "text": "En effet, le masque-cheval-jupon, les divers jeux et danses en decoulant, sont une manifestation universelle, comme de nombreux travaux d'erudition l'ont amplement mis en evidence.",
                                "translation": "In effect, the hobby-horse-masque, the resulting diverse games and dances, are a universal manifestation, as many scholarly works have amply demonstrated.",
                                "english": "In effect, the hobby-horse-masque, the resulting diverse games and dances, are a universal manifestation, as many scholarly works have amply demonstrated."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
